    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Grinzing, Nussdorf, and Oberdöbling each opened breweries in the early 1800s, with Nussdorf’s boom standing out.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
