      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/D%C3%B6bling",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Krottenbach stream once dominated Döbling’s landscape, now largely buried beneath modern pipes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/D%C3%B6bling",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Sievering’s Gräf & Stift automobile factory, established early 1900s, became one of Vienna’s leading industrial plants.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
